@* The column headers of every experience table, matching <MetricCells /> (FR-EXP-04). *@
<th scope="col" title="Times the role was called">Turns</th>
<th scope="col" title="Turns proposing an entry">Approvals</th>
<th scope="col" title="Turns proposing no trade while an entry was on the table">Rejections</th>
<th scope="col" title="Closed trades whose entry the role proposed">Trades</th>
<th scope="col">Win rate</th>
<th scope="col" title="Mean gross R per trade">Avg R</th>
<th scope="col" title="Mean net R per trade, after fees and funding">Expectancy</th>
<th scope="col" title="Gross profit over gross loss, in R">Profit factor</th>
<th scope="col" title="Share of the resolved rejections that avoided a loss">Rejections right</th>
<th scope="col" title="Share of the scope's gross loss on trades this role proposed">Drawdown share</th>
<th scope="col" title="Risk Manager outputs the hard limits clamped">Clamped</th>
<th scope="col" title="Turns that failed or timed out">Failed</th>
<th scope="col">Latency</th>
